 "remarks": "Experience pride of ownership in this beautifully refreshed Colonial located in Stamford's highly desirable waterside neighborhood. Conveniently situated within walking distance of Boccuzzi Park, several marinas, and Innis Arden Golf Club, this home's exceptional location offers the perfect blend of coastal living and everyday convenience. Inside, you'll find 3 spacious bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms, and gleaming hardwood floors throughout. Additional highlights include a detached one-car garage, level lot, a fully fenced in backyard exceptional for pets and a bright, well maintained interior that reflects true pride of ownership. With its charming character and unbeatable location, this home is a wonderful rental opportunity in one of Stamford's most sought after neighborhoods. Make your appointment today.",
